<title>FRANCE: Rouen May 1-28 flour exports at 32,508 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Rouen May 1-28 flour exports at 32,508 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Flour exports from Rouen reached 32,508 tonnes between May 1 and May 28, port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Flour exports for the whole of May 1996 were 34,000 tonnes.</p>
<p>May 1-28 exports included 10,075 tonnes to west Africa, 10,523 tonnes to Ethiopia and 11,910 tonnes to Libya, they said. --Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
